# Everything in this repo executes on Linux (bash, patch, python inside the
# container image via `COPY . .`), so CRLF working trees break it. Force LF
# regardless of the cloning machine's core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Explicit: launchers and patches must stay LF + diffable.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.patch text diff
# Model/training artifacts must never get line-ending conversion or text diffs
# if one is ever force-added for inspection.
*.safetensors binary
*.pt binary
*.npy binary
*.mmap binary
